and in this case, what we'll

293
00:16:20,890 --> 00:16:23,610
have for our signs and
symptoms, the mechanism is

294
00:16:23,610 --> 00:16:26,250
actually important to
know. What we'll see is the

295
00:16:26,250 --> 00:16:29,590
