acid in the bile itself,

305
00:16:58,430 --> 00:17:01,340
and this is actually a
mediator of the pruritus.

306
00:17:02,450 --> 00:17:06,130
The bile itself is also
made of cholesterol, and

307
00:17:06,130 --> 00:17:09,330
so what happens is because
the bile is unable to

308
00:17:09,330 --> 00:17:12,230
