itself. So what we'll have

332
00:18:28,970 --> 00:18:31,490
is actually the bile will
be conjugated. You'll have

333
00:18:31,490 --> 00:18:35,070
a direct or conjugated
hyperbilirubinemia. In

334
00:18:35,070 --> 00:18:38,830
about 93% of cases, you'll
actually have a positive

335
00:18:39,110 --> 00:18:40,630
