336
00:18:40,750 --> 00:18:44,310
However, in about 7% of
those cases, the people that

337
00:18:44,310 --> 00:18:46,930
were missing, we can
actually go forward with the

338
00:18:46,930 --> 00:18:50,150
liver biopsy. And there's
staging that's demonstrated

339
00:18:50,150 --> 00:18:53,830
stage 1 to stage 4, ultimately
leading to cirrhosis.

340
00:18:53,830 --> 00:18:56,010
But what's important
for you to know is that

341
00:18:56,010 --> 00:18:59,410
initially you'll see portal
inflammation, and around

342
00:18:59,410 --> 00:19:02,430
the ducts you'll see
fibrosis. In the areas that

343
00:19:02,430 --> 00:19:05,330
aren't involved in terms
of the biliary ducts and

344
00:19:05,330 --> 00:19:08,250
biliary treat, they'll be
dilated, and what's commonly

345
00:19:08,250 --> 00:19:12,090
described is a beaded
appearance on imaging. The

346
00:19:12,090 --> 00:19:16,280
