is USDA, or ursodeoxycholic

347
00:19:16,390 --> 00:19:19,230
acid, and what this does
is it breaks down the

348
00:19:19,230 --> 00:19:22,870
cholesterol to facilitate
bile excretion. So this

349
00:19:22,870 --> 00:19:25,770
doesn't actually regress your
disease, but it does slow

350
00:19:25,770 --> 00:19:28,630
down the disease
progression, especially with

351
00:19:28,630 --> 00:19:31,790
slowing down the histological
progression and changes.

352
00:19:35,090 --> 00:19:38,690
Now we'll be discussing
pernicious anemia, and in

353
00:19:38,690 --> 00:19:42,600
this case the mechanism of
action is IgG autoantibodies

354
00:19:42,670 --> 00:19:45,590
against the parietal
cells or intrinsic

355
00:19:45,590 --> 00:19:49,990
factor, and these two
somewhat go hand in hand. So

356
00:19:49,990 --> 00:19:52,970
what we have is the process
