361
00:20:07,820 --> 00:20:10,550
When we have production
of these antibodies

362
00:20:10,550 --> 00:20:13,490
against the intrinsic
factor there's prevention

363
00:20:13,490 --> 00:20:16,610
of this uptake and so
what happens is the plasma

364
00:20:16,610 --> 00:20:20,510
cells in your gastric
mucosa actually secrete

365
00:20:20,510 --> 00:20:22,990
this antibody into the
lumen of the stomach.

366
00:20:23,350 --> 00:20:26,270
Again, this is organ
specific. We're specifically

367
00:20:26,270 --> 00:20:29,670
dealing with gastroparietal
cells. However, the signs

368
00:20:29,670 --> 00:20:32,170
and stigmata of this
disease process will be seen

369
00:20:32,170 --> 00:20:36,910
throughout the body. So what
we'll have here is angular

370
00:20:36,910 --> 00:20:39,850
colitis, which looks like
cracked lips in the corner

371
00:20:39,850 --> 00:20:43,190
of your mouth. Commonly,
people will mistake these

372
00:20:43,190 --> 00:20:47,430
for cold sores. Along that
same line you'll also see

373
00:20:47,430 --> 00:20:51,090
