as well as fatigue.

385
00:21:30,330 --> 00:21:34,250
In terms of the diagnosis
of pernicious anemia,

386
00:21:34,250 --> 00:21:36,810
we can actually do lab
testing with your blood

387
00:21:36,810 --> 00:21:40,430
or serum for vitamin
B12 amounts, And so what

388
00:21:40,430 --> 00:21:43,960
