or level of vitamin B12.

389
00:21:43,960 --> 00:21:47,290
In terms of the anemia
itself, if you're thinking

390
00:21:47,290 --> 00:21:51,230
of a microcytic, normocytic,
or macrocytic picture,

391
00:21:51,230 --> 00:21:54,690
specifically in reference
to the MCV, or mean

392
00:21:54,690 --> 00:21:57,830
corpuscular volume, what
we'll find is that these

393
00:21:57,830 --> 00:22:02,130
