402
00:22:27,970 --> 00:22:31,470
for homocysteine as well
as methylmalonic acid

403
00:22:31,470 --> 00:22:34,130
And what we'll find in
the case of pernicious

404
00:22:34,130 --> 00:22:37,630
anemia, specifically from
what we're talking about

405
00:22:37,630 --> 00:22:40,670
here in low vitamin
B12, you have increased

406
00:22:40,670 --> 00:22:44,470
