your methylmalonic

409
00:22:49,310 --> 00:22:52,130
acid levels, or
MMA, will be normal.

410
00:22:52,470 --> 00:22:55,130
Other testing can also
be completed, such

411
00:22:55,130 --> 00:22:57,950
as endoscopy with
biopsy. and I'll talk to

412
00:22:57,950 --> 00:22:59,950
you a little bit about
the Schilling test,

413
00:22:59,950 --> 00:23:02,250
which has somewhat
fallen to the wayside.

414
00:23:02,870 --> 00:23:06,210
In terms of the treatment,
specifically we're looking

415
00:23:06,210 --> 00:23:10,130
at vitamin B12 with
intramuscular injections and

416
00:23:10,220 --> 00:23:12,990
