often fallen to the wayside.

446
00:24:46,150 --> 00:24:49,630
next we'll be talking about
ulcerative colitis and

447
00:24:49,630 --> 00:24:52,790
oftentimes what we see especially
when it comes to testing

448
00:24:52,790 --> 00:24:56,610
is ulcerative colitis as
an entity is often compared

449
00:24:56,610 --> 00:24:59,290
