in ulcerative colitis I'm

469
00:26:00,750 --> 00:26:03,010
mentioning that the ******
is typically involved.

470
00:26:03,690 --> 00:26:06,650
In terms of the signs
and symptoms, what you'll

471
00:26:06,650 --> 00:26:10,050
actually find is that
smoking is protective in

472
00:26:10,050 --> 00:26:12,490
ulcerative colitis. I
don't think it's a great

473
00:26:12,490 --> 00:26:15,090
reason to tell your patients
to smoke, but in terms

474
00:26:15,090 --> 00:26:17,410
of presentations, you'll
have ****** diarrhea,

475
00:26:17,710 --> 00:26:20,030
bright red blood
per ******, anemia

476
00:26:20,030 --> 00:26:22,090
can also be seen,
as well as, as I

477
00:26:22,090 --> 00:26:24,390
mentioned, that left
lower quadrant pain.

478
00:26:24,390 --> 00:26:26,930
What you'll also find
is there's inflammation

479
00:26:26,930 --> 00:26:30,270
really in multiple places.
For example, you'll

480
00:26:30,270 --> 00:26:33,210
