579
00:32:06,930 --> 00:32:09,190
think about it a little
bit more broadly and make

580
00:32:09,190 --> 00:32:12,270
sure you're considering all
senses of the differential.

581
00:32:12,270 --> 00:32:15,610
If there's vascular causes,
inflammatory causes, is

582
00:32:15,610 --> 00:32:18,890
it drug-induced, idiopathic,
in this case, what are

583
00:32:18,890 --> 00:32:22,150
the autoimmune considerations,
or endocrine, metabolic.

584
00:32:22,470 --> 00:32:25,090
So what we're looking at
