603
00:33:15,570 --> 00:33:18,090
Next, we'll turn
our attention over

604
00:33:18,090 --> 00:33:20,570
to autoimmune diseases
of the kidney.

605
00:33:20,570 --> 00:33:23,270
And what you'll find is
there's actually a whole

606
00:33:23,270 --> 00:33:27,480
host of nephrotic and
nephritic syndromes and kidney

607
00:33:27,480 --> 00:33:29,910
pathologies that you'll
have to study and ultimately

608
00:33:29,910 --> 00:33:33,590
know for the boards and
for clinical practice. But

609
00:33:33,590 --> 00:33:36,770
what we'll do here is
go over a few key select

610
00:33:36,770 --> 00:33:40,470
conditions that you'll see
in widespread populations and

611
00:33:40,470 --> 00:33:43,230
