group A strep infection.

637
00:35:11,430 --> 00:35:14,870
However, it can progress
to renal disease in adults.

638
00:35:14,990 --> 00:35:17,770
Some of the other findings
that you might see is

639
00:35:17,770 --> 00:35:20,670
periorbital and peripheral
edema, that's in line

640
00:35:20,670 --> 00:35:22,910
with the nephrotic
syndrome. And because the

641
00:35:22,910 --> 00:35:25,450
