diagnosis of PSGN.

652
00:36:04,990 --> 00:36:08,040
If you were to proceed
with immunofluorescence

653
00:36:08,040 --> 00:36:10,670
microscopy, what you
might find or common

654
00:36:10,670 --> 00:36:13,430
descriptions are a starry
night appearance or a

655
00:36:13,430 --> 00:36:15,890
lumpy bumpy appearance,
and this is because of

656
00:36:15,890 --> 00:36:19,350
