which will present with

689
00:38:11,230 --> 00:38:14,410
hematuria or blood in the
urine. Typically, this is

690
00:38:14,410 --> 00:38:18,110
described in adults, and this
is a type 3 hypersensitivity

691
00:38:18,110 --> 00:38:21,530
reaction because of the
interaction of the IgM and

692
00:38:21,530 --> 00:38:25,110
IgG, as well as complex
formation with your antigen.

693
00:38:27,570 --> 00:38:31,250
In regards to the diagnosis
of Goodpasture syndrome,

694
00:38:31,250 --> 00:38:34,750
what we'll find in over
90% of cases is actually

695
00:38:34,750 --> 00:38:38,650
